sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as React app
  participant SEC as JWT filter
  participant AC as AuthController
  participant AS as AuthService
  participant DB as MySQL
  U->>FE: Email + password
  FE->>AC: POST /api/auth/login
  AC->>AS: login()
  AS->>DB: find user by email
  DB-->>AS: user + BCrypt hash
  AS->>AS: BCrypt matches(password, hash)
  alt wrong email or password
    AS-->>FE: 401 "Invalid email or password."
  else correct
    AS-->>FE: JWT (user id + role, 8 h) + user
    FE->>FE: store token, open home page for the role
  end
  Note over FE,SEC: Every later request
  FE->>SEC: GET /api/student/... with Authorization: Bearer token
  SEC->>SEC: verify signature and expiry, load user, set role
  alt role allowed for this path
    SEC->>AC: continue to the controller
  else wrong role
    SEC-->>FE: 403 "Your account role cannot access this."
  end
